><\/o:p><\/span><\/b><\/p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">進行民間借款需要注意以下幾點：<\/span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><o:p><\/o:p><\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">1. <\/span><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">利率上限：根據台灣法律，民間借款的年利率不得超過<\/span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">20%<\/span><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">。<\/span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><o:p><\/o:p><\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">2. <\/span><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">合約要求：所有借款活動必須有書面合約作為法律依據。<\/span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><o:p><\/o:p><\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">3. <\/span><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">還款計劃：制定一個可行的還款計劃，以避免未來的法律糾紛。<\/span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><o:p><\/o:p><\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">4. <\/span><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">風險與責任：不守合約規定可能會導致法律問題，因此借款與還款應嚴格遵守約定。<\/span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 18